  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Request to change the verbiage in the eye movement section of the SDK to be more clear. Currently 'Calm', 'Excited', 'Shy', and 'Confident' do a poor job of conveying what changes are being made to the eye behavior in game.\n\nFor example, changing 'Calm' and 'Excited' to 'Blink Less' 'Blink More'\n\nChanging 'Shy' and 'Confident' to 'Less Eye Contact' 'More Eye Contact'\n\nThese changes would make it more clear how the eyes will react in game.",
